            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-26T03:48:26.769756+00:00",
            "notes": "**Round 1** is all about doing JQ things. Get up in their faces and keep them bleeding. If your team pushes with you it will be hard to get flanked and you might finish with anywhere from 1k healing to 3k on a really good first round.\n\nIf all goes well, you should be receiving a lot more attention from your supports as you heal the rest of your team.\n\nIt's important to note that you can't take a step back with this build until much later rounds. Play as aggressively as you would usually with JQ, and make sure melee's are constantly flying to keep bleed up and you right in their face's. [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) theoretically are great in this build, but I feel like they are a but under-tuned and unnecessary, given the extra attention from healers, but if you need the healing definitely take it.",
            "stats": {
