            "created_at": "2025-08-26T03:48:26.769756+00:00",
            "notes": "I'm working on a new build since I lost this one, but I'll fill this in for the meantime.\n\nIf things are going well, by round 3 you should be able to afford  [Booming Voice](item_d751b552-4c3f-49d6-966b-611096fd2259) and  [Undying Loyalty](item_d0278c35-8006-4c8d-8f02-4fd0217fd3e2) . These are the 2 core items of this build, but if you aren't able to afford both of these, take  [Reckoner\u2019s Roar](item_efe615c6-8b32-4847-9d8f-4f55adaeba52) over  [Let\u2019s Go Win](item_80df18f3-8530-4e55-8ea3-9ac7a3f12508) and switch to the  [Thrill of Battle](item_80ed7f65-e015-4dbb-ada0-fb8fa9b9b086) build. \n\nNow, with  [Booming Voice](item_d751b552-4c3f-49d6-966b-611096fd2259) and  [Let\u2019s Go Win](item_80df18f3-8530-4e55-8ea3-9ac7a3f12508) you can spam your shouts as soon as they come up and support your whole team without a worry in the world. Keep pressure up, and remember to spend any extra cash on AP items due to their scaling with all your wounds, which mean more healing.",
